{"book":"measurement","bookTitle":"Measurement and time","concept":7,"title":"Time intervals and timetables","grades":"Grades 5–7","goal":"I can work out time intervals and read timetables.","teach":"Count on in steps: to the next whole hour, then whole hours, then the minutes left. 08:35 → 09:00 is 25 min; 09:00 → 11:00 is 2 h; 11:00 → 11:10 is 10 min; total 2 h 35 min = 155 min. Do not subtract times like ordinary numbers: there are 60 minutes in an hour, not 100.","tvis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:676px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 98\"><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"40.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"40.0\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"86.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">08:35</text><line x1=\"128.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"128.0\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"128.0\" y=\"86.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">09:00</text><line x1=\"414.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"414.0\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"414.0\" y=\"86.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">11:00</text><line x1=\"480.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"480.0\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"480.0\" y=\"86.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">11:10</text><path d=\"M40.0,59 Q84.0,12.6 128.0,59\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M121.0,52 L128.0,59 L127.0,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"84.0\" y=\"29.8\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">25 min</text><path d=\"M128.0,59 Q271.0,7.0 414.0,59\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M407.0,52 L414.0,59 L412.9,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"271.0\" y=\"27.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2 h</text><path d=\"M414.0,59 Q447.0,19.2 480.0,59\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M473.0,52 L480.0,59 L478.9,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"447.0\" y=\"33.1\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">10 min</text></svg></span></div>","ex":{"q":"A flight leaves at 22:30 and lands at 06:15 the next day. How long is the flight?","steps":["22:30 → 00:00 is 1 h 30 min.","00:00 → 06:00 is 6 h; 06:00 → 06:15 is 15 min.","Total: 7 h 45 min = 465 min."]},"watch":"11:10 − 08:35 is not 2,75 hours: count on with 60 minutes in an hour.<br><br><b>Problem-solving lens</b><br>Draw a time line and jump to the next whole hour first.","qs":[{"text":"How many minutes from 13:50 to 15:15?","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Minutes","a":"85","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"10 + 60 + 15","steps":"1. Rule: to find a time difference, count on to the next whole hour, then the whole hours, then the minutes left.<br>2. 13:50 → 14:00 = 10 min<br>3. 14:00 → 15:00 = 60 min<br>4. 15:00 → 15:15 = 15 min<br>5. 10 + 60 + 15 = 85 min"},{"text":"A match starts at 10:45 and lasts 1 h 50 min. When does it end?","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Hours","a":"12","form":"val","o":null},{"t":"box","label":"Minutes","a":"35","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"10:45 + 1 h 50","steps":"1. Rule: add the hours first, then the minutes.<br>2. 10:45 + 1 h = 11:45<br>3. 11:45 + 50 min = 12:35"},{"text":"A bus leaves Rosebank at 07:12 and arrives in Sandton at 07:41. How long is the trip?","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Minutes","a":"29","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"07:41 − 07:12","steps":"1. Rule: the hours are the same, so subtract the minutes.<br>2. 41 − 12 = 29 min"}]}